# Route: guide 41 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Orc (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 58, 48
# quests, 3.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Hillsbrad Foothills, Alterac Mountains, Eastern Plaguelands,
# Silverpine Forest, Dustwallow Marsh, Durotar, Stranglethorn Vale,
# Undercity): Tarren Mill -> Dalaran -> Growless Cave -> Dandred's Fold -> The
# Marris Stead -> Darrowshire -> Lake Mereldar -> Northpass Tower -> The
# Marris Stead -> Tyr's Hand -> The Marris Stead -> Tarren Mill -> Fenris Isle
# -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Crown of Will (518; Crushridge
# Mauler 36-37); The Crown of Will (519; Targ 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39);
# The Crimson Courier (6145; Crimson Courier 60); The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria
# (6148; Demetria 61); The Crown of Will (520; Mug'thol 43); Assault on Fenris
# Isle (442; Thule Ravenclaw 24); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (736;
# Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Grave Knight (96986), Heart of Disruption (96984), The
# Grave Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987), Dawn's Gambit (4771),
# The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi
# (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond
# (5263), The Restless Souls (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued
